{
  "dom_id": "step-453675",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Computing a Reciprocal Ratio of a Quadrantal Angle",
  "problem": "Find the value of $\\csc \\left(0\\right).$",
  "worked_solution": "The angle $0$ is a quadrantal angle. Let's draw out the quadrantal angles on the unit circle.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14249810/assets/edad8c833f65c54453fe40a326cbf9394c263213934447872b530a8e4fb86de1.png)\n\nFrom the unit circle, we see that the angle $0$ corresponds to the point $(1,0).$\n\nSince the sine of the angle corresponds to the $y$-coordinate, we have $\\sin{\\left(0\\right)} = 0.$\n\nTherefore, using the fact that $\\csc{\\theta} = \\dfrac{1}{\\sin\\theta},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\csc{\\left(0\\right)} = \\dfrac{1}{\\sin{\\left(0\\right)}} = \\dfrac{1}{0}.\n$$\n\nHowever, division by zero is undefined. Therefore, $\\csc\\left(0\\right)$ is undefined.",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-453675\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"453675\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"3865\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-453675\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-9\">Computing a Reciprocal Ratio of a Quadrantal Angle</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"453675\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n             